The '''Carrot King Avatar''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears in {{zone|The Garden}}. They can appear if the player consumes a {{Item|Poignant Carrot Bait}}. Completing their offer rewards the player with a {{Item|Poignant Lucky Clover}}, along with the base rewards.

